# Heading 1 한글 漢字 😀

Setext heading
==============

Paragraph with *emphasis*, **strong**, ***both***, ~~strike~~, `inline code` and a [link](https://example.com "title").
Auto link <https://example.com> and ![image](path/to/img.png) and footnote[^1].

> Blockquote with **bold**
> second line

- item one
  - nested item with `code`
- [ ] task
- [x] done

1. first
2. second

| Column | Value |
| ------ | ----: |
| a      |     1 |

```json
{ "key": [1, true, null] }
```

```ts
const value: number = 1 // comment
```

```rust
fn main() { println!("hi"); }
```

```sh
echo "$HOME" | grep -v '^#'
```

